Robocopy without changing destination permissions
We currently have a disk that has files we need to copy  (Old Data) - files have everyone permissions

&amp;#x200B;

We need to copy it to a destination file server, without loosing the permissions on folders set at the destination location

&amp;#x200B;

Does anyone know what flag we should be using?

This is my current command, but it causes us to loose permissions at the destination:

&amp;#x200B;

robocopy \\\\oldata\\DIR   I:\\FileShare /e /zb /copy:DATSOU /r:3 w:3 /V  /MT:128
